  <!-- VERDICT -->
  <section id="verdict" style="position:relative;padding:96px 64px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a201b 0%,#061714 100%);border-top:1px solid var(--rulesoft)">
    <div style="position:absolute;right:24px;top:96px;writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:rotate(180deg);font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--t4)">Verdict</div>
    <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto">
      <span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal)">Verdicts</span>
      <h2 style="font-weight:700;font-size:42px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:12px;color:var(--t1);max-width:760px">Three outcomes. None of them is a score.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--t2);max-width:640px;margin-top:14px">The workspace does not collapse review into true or false. It exposes what the trusted corpus can support, what it only partly supports, and where it is silent.</p>

      <div id="tlSpikeWrap" style="position:relative;height:440px;margin-top:40px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#06140f">
        <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 80% at 50% 50%, #0c241d 0%, #04100d 100%)"></div>
        <canvas id="tlSpikeCanvas" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%"></canvas>
        <div id="tlKeywordLayer" style="position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none"></div>
        <div id="tlNodeLayer" style="position:absolute;inset:0"></div>
        <div style="position:absolute;left:20px;bottom:16px;font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--t4)">Verdict space · hover a node to name it</div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:20px">
        <article id="tlCard-supported" class="vcard" style="border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;padding:26px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 12%,rgba(49,152,138,.1),transparent 42%),#081d18">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px"><span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal)"></span><span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--t3)">Verdict</span></div>
          <h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:25px;margin-top:14px;color:var(--t1)">Supported</h3>
          <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t2);margin-top:10px">Evidence in the corpus backs the claim. The supporting passage is retrieved and cited exactly.</p>
        </article>
        <article id="tlCard-partial" class="vcard" style="border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;padding:26px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 12%,rgba(216,178,94,.1),transparent 42%),#0e1c12">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px"><span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1.4px solid var(--gold);background:transparent"></span><span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--t3)">Verdict</span></div>
          <h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:25px;margin-top:14px;color:var(--t1)">Partial</h3>
          <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t2);margin-top:10px">Some of the claim is backed; part is not, or only holds under specific conditions. Graded, non-binary — not collapsed to true or false.</p>
        </article>
        <article id="tlCard-unsupported" class="vcard" style="border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:14px;padding:26px;background:#0a1813">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px"><span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1.2px solid var(--t3);background:transparent"></span><span style="font-family:var(--fmono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--t3)">Verdict</span></div>
          <h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:25px;margin-top:14px;color:var(--t1)">Unsupported</h3>
          <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--t2);margin-top:10px">This corpus is silent on the claim — not that the claim is wrong. Results are a starting point for a human reviewer, not a final verdict on the work.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

